{"task_id": "HumanEval/29", "solution": "from typing import List\ndef filter_by_prefix(strings: List[str], prefix: str) -> List[str]:\n    \"\"\"Filters a list of strings, returning only those that start with the specified prefix.\n    Raises TypeError if 'strings' is not a list or 'prefix' is not a string.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(strings, list):\n        raise TypeError(\"Input 'strings' must be a list.\")\n    if not isinstance(prefix, str):\n        raise TypeError(\"Input 'prefix' must be a string.\")\n\n    return [s for s in strings if isinstance(s, str) and s.startswith(prefix)]"}
